<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-EVOLUTION OF HIGHEST TEST INNINGS TOTAL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-EVOLUTION OF HIGHEST TEST INNINGS TOTAL.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Evolution of the highest innings</p>
<p>total in test cricket after Sri Lanka scored 952 for six on the</p>
<p>final day of the first test against India on Wednesday:</p>
<p>695 - Australia v England, The Oval, 1930</p>
<p>699-5 - Pakistan v India, Lahore, 1989-90</p>
<p>701 - Australia v England, The Oval , 1934</p>
<p>708 - Pakistan v England, The Oval, 1987</p>
<p>729-6 dec - Australia v England, Lord's, 1930</p>
<p>758-8 dec Australia v West Indies, Kingston, 1954-55</p>
<p>790-3 dec West Indies v Pakistan, Kingston, 1957-58</p>
<p>849 - England v West Indies, Kingston, 1929-30</p>
<p>903-7 dec - England v Australia, The Oval, 1938</p>
<p>952-6 - Sri Lanka v India, Colombo, 1997</p>
</text>
